Form cheatsheet

<form> one per pahe, inputs inside this tag get saved 
<input> as many inputs as questions 
      <input attribute= "something'> as many attributes as need open tag;
      like text email passowrd color tuns of types

type= 'sumbut' one per page,inside form tags 
name = '--' need a name to save the form data 
value= '-' puts a value on the page = mulitple choice(radio) = dropdown(selet)





